CLASS com/mojang/realmsclient/gui/screens/RealmsTermsScreen
	FIELD lastScreen Lnet/minecraft/client/gui/screens/Screen;
		COMMENT The screen to display when OK is clicked on the disconnect screen.
		COMMENT
		COMMENT Seems to be an instance of either {@link net.minecraft.client.gui.screens.multiplayer.JoinMultiplayerScreen} (when connecting to a server) or {@link com.mojang.realmsclient.gui.screens.RealmsTermsScreen} (when connecting to MCO server)
	METHOD keyPressed (III)Z
